20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I appreciate the caution, but we must not let cost fears paralyze us. I need to know if the earlier efforts actually helped patients before we judge them.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I agree. But without capacity, even a successful program fails. I am checking the physical limits to ensure we do not seize up.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I agree. But without capacity, even a successful program fails. I am checking the physical limits to ensure we do not seize up.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
